{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "rates-lev-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.82: `rates-lev` -- `userdb-lev` at Rates scale (MESOSCALE_LOOKUP): THC, CO, NOx and NMHC at running and start exhaust for 21, 31 and 32, every fuel MOVES adds, Washtenaw, DEFAULT domain, 2020, August, weekday, hour 7, over the same LEV user input database (`inputs/washtenaw-userdb-lev.esm`). userdb-lev's PM2.5 group is left out: a first capture with it failed inside the capture container (\"No space left on device\" bundling into /opt/moves/sharedwork), and the LEV database carries no PM row at 2020 anyway.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the merged rate on the RATE path: BaseRateGenerator reads the merged emissionRateByAge (796,173 execution rows at the run's pollutant-processes, reproduced exactly in pandas, 48,657 of them the user's) and the rate tables are written from BaseRateOutput, so every table but StartsPerVehicle carries the LEV rates at 1999-2003 and 2010-2017.\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to the chain's `rateSurvivorCount`; `n_sourceBin` 2 and `n_physicsRow` 7 as in `userdb-lev`; `n_ratesScale` 1.\n\nNo `db_movesoutput` here: a Rates run's oracle is its rate tables.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "runspec",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "rates",
      "user-input-database",
      "lev"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-lev/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020: ages 0-40 are model years 1980-2020, so the run holds cohorts at LEV rates (1999-2003, 2010-2017) and at default rates on both sides of each kept band (1980-1998, 2004-2009, 2018-2020).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-lev/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
